  "title": "Seared Ahi Tuna with Blackberry-Passion Fruit Marinade",
  "description": "Ahi tuna marinated in a blackberry-passion fruit marinade and seared briefly in a hot skillet is a delicious summer dish that pairs nicely with steamed white rice or vegetables.",
  "authors": [
    "Cher Stewart"
  ],
